    "created_at": "2019-10-07T12:47:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-10-07T12:47:59Z",
    "body": "I'm not sure I understand either. There's a problem with the initial `load` event, but it also sounds like Chrome/Safari do fire a `load` for \"downloads\" and Firefox does not. I'm not sure the specification does so I'm not sure if the \"spec-compliant way\" is indeed working in theory or would also end up removing the `iframe` element too early.",
