    "updated_at": "2019-10-15T16:41:59Z",
    "body": "How do things behave when there are multiple iframe elements being inserted, whether via a single append operation on an ancestor, via document fragment insertion, via innerHTML, etc?  What does ordering for the load events look like and how does it order with the rest of the insertion process?",
